# oracle: fix langevin angmom 2.0 (rotational thermostat of ellipsoids, body-frame damping and random torque, as in the align_self/in.alignself_quat example) with scale 2 1.5 on type 2, 12 ellipsoids (8 of type 1, 4 of type 2, explicit quaternions and angmom), nve/asphere, 150 steps at timestep 0.004; the per-atom angmom sums are compared through thermo, the final positions and velocities through the atom dump
# oracle-compare: thermo=all atoms=all rel=1e-8 abs=1e-10
# Measured: the engine matches native to below 1e-14 relative (passes at rel=1e-14); the thermo and atom columns carry the rotational thermostat (the angmom sums move from 0.165 to -0.046 over the run).
units           lj
atom_style      ellipsoid
dimension       3
boundary        p p p
region          box block 0 6 0 6 0 6
create_box      2 box
create_atoms    1 random 8 4321 box
create_atoms    2 random 4 987 box
set             type 1 density 1.5
set             type 2 density 1.0
set             type 1 shape 0.5 0.4 0.3
set             type 2 shape 0.3 0.3 0.3
set             atom 1 quat 0.3 0.5 0.7 40
set             atom 2 quat 0.1 -0.8 0.4 75
set             atom 3 quat -0.6 0.2 0.5 130
set             atom 4 quat 0.9 0.1 -0.2 15
set             atom 5 quat 0.2 0.7 -0.6 95
set             atom 6 quat -0.4 -0.3 0.8 60
set             atom 7 quat 0.5 0.5 0.1 200
set             atom 8 quat 0.7 -0.2 0.6 33
set             atom 9 quat 0.3 0.3 0.9 110
set             atom 10 quat -0.8 0.4 0.1 250
set             atom 11 quat 0.6 -0.5 0.5 5
set             atom 12 quat 0.1 0.9 0.4 170
set             atom * angmom 0.1 -0.2 0.3
pair_style      lj/cut 1.0
pair_coeff      * * 0.0 1.0
compute         p all property/atom angmomx angmomy angmomz
variable        w1 atom c_p[1]*(1+0.1*id)
variable        w2 atom c_p[2]*(1+0.1*id)
variable        w3 atom c_p[3]*(1+0.1*id)
compute         r all reduce sum v_w1 v_w2 v_w3
fix             1 all nve/asphere
fix             2 all langevin 0.8 0.8 0.5 4321 scale 2 1.5 angmom 2.0
timestep        0.004
thermo_style    custom step atoms pe ke c_r[1] c_r[2] c_r[3]
thermo_modify   format float %.15g
thermo          25
run             150
